4. Wrapped the SingleSelectFilterOptions with our MockDataTableProvider instead of the original DataTableProvider

This approach should resolve the context error by providing all the necessary context values that the component needs. The mock context simulates what the real DataTableProvider would provide, but in a more controlled way for our preview environment.

